IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `lga-compilations`

-- Tests of lga-compilations.l4 (Chapter 2 Part 2, sections 15P to 15X).
-- Every expected value is written by hand from the text; the provision and the reading are named beside each group.


§§ `s 15P: information in a registered compilation (text lines 475 to 483)`

-- ruler: compilation date; editorial changes made; statement of changes; (c) details of amending laws; (d) amendment history; (e) further prescribed information; satisfied (c) available; satisfied (d) available; satisfied (e) available; indicates how to access
#ASSERT `s 15P: the registered compilation includes the information it must include` (`Facts about a registered compilation` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 15P: the registered compilation includes the information it must include` (`Facts about a registered compilation` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 15P: the registered compilation includes the information it must include` (`Facts about a registered compilation` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 15P: the registered compilation includes the information it must include` (`Facts about a registered compilation` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 15P: the registered compilation includes the information it must include` (`Facts about a registered compilation` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 15P: the registered compilation includes the information it must include` (`Facts about a registered compilation` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 15P: the registered compilation includes the information it must include` (`Facts about a registered compilation` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 15P: the registered compilation includes the information it must include` (`Facts about a registered compilation` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 15P: the registered compilation includes the information it must include` (`Facts about a registered compilation` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 15P: the registered compilation includes the information it must include` (`Facts about a registered compilation` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 15P: the registered compilation includes the information it must include` (`Facts about a registered compilation` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 15P: the registered compilation includes the information it must include` (`Facts about a registered compilation` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 15P: the registered compilation includes the information it must include` (`Facts about a registered compilation` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 15P: the registered compilation includes the information it must include` (`Facts about a registered compilation` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 15P: the registered compilation includes the information it must include` (`Facts about a registered compilation` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE)
