#ASSERT `s 15T(2): the day after which the First Parliamentary Counsel must register as soon as practicable` (Date 10 3 2026) FALSE (Date 22 4 2026) (JUST (Date 21 4 2026)) EQUALS (Date 21 4 2026)
#ASSERT `s 15T(2): the day after which the First Parliamentary Counsel must register as soon as practicable` (Date 10 3 2026) FALSE (Date 22 4 2026) (JUST (Date 1 4 2026)) EQUALS (Date 7 4 2026)

